    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MultipleUsers.Desc">喺 Windows 用全新嘅多帳戶模式玩遊戲</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.NeoLaunch.Title">新啟動方式</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.NeoLaunch.Desc">喺 Linux 用新嘅啟動方式，包含 XBOX 帳戶登入</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.Title">滑鼠鎖</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.Desc">防止滑鼠越過遊戲視窗邊界，避免誤觸其他內容</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.Main.Title">總開關</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.Main.Desc">只有總開關開咗，功能先會生效</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.Advance">進階</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.ForGdk.Title">對 GDK 版本生效</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.ForGdk.Desc">正常情況下，只有 UWP 版本先至需要滑鼠鎖</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.Reserve.Title">舊版邏輯</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.Reserve.Desc">除非新版滑鼠鎖邏輯唔能夠如常運作，否則你唔應該開呢個掣</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.Reserve.Warn">舊版滑鼠鎖邏輯比較粗暴，除咗不必要嘅 CPU 消耗之外，仲會令其他應用或者遊戲自帶嘅滑鼠鎖定邏輯出現異常，&#10;而且會令解除鎖定嘅熱鍵運作異常。&#10;除非新版滑鼠鎖邏輯唔能夠如常運作，否則你真係唔應該開呢個掣！&#10;&#10;確定仲要開？</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.WindowTrimming.Title">四邊減去嘅像素數量</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.WindowTrimming.Desc">喺視窗四邊減少量像素，防止遊戲全螢幕或者隱藏工作列而且遊戲最大化嗰陣，滑鼠誤觸工作列</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.GetFrame.Title">UWP 視窗擷取優先設定</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.GetFrame.Desc">設定 UWP 框架視窗擷取策略。</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.GetFrame.Default">啟動時監視框架</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.GetFrame.Legacy">喺遊戲度攞框架</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.Hotkey.Title">熱鍵綁定</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.Hotkey.Desc">綁定臨時解除滑鼠鎖定嘅熱鍵</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.Hotkey.Capturing">擷取緊，撳 Esc 取消</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.Group.Advanced">進階</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Title">自訂命令</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Desc">設定啟動前命令、啟動後命令同執行包裝器</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Main.Title">總開關</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Main.Desc">只有總開關開咗，下面嘅自訂命令先會生效</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Group.Hooks">命令</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Pre.Title">啟動前命令</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Pre.Desc">喺遊戲程序啟動之前執行嘅命令</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Pre.Watermark">例如：taskkill /IM SomeApp.exe</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Post.Title">啟動後命令</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Post.Desc">喺遊戲程序結束之後執行嘅命令</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Post.Watermark">例如：shutdown /s /t 60</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Group.Wrapper">執行包裝器</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Wrapper.Title">包裝器命令</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Wrapper.Desc">用 %command% 代表原本嘅遊戲啟動命令，留空就唔用包裝器</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Wrapper.Watermark">例如：gamemoderun %command%</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Wrapper.Unsupported.Title">包裝器喺 Windows 用唔到</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Wrapper.Unsupported.Desc">Windows 嘅遊戲透過 UWP/GDK 包啟動，冇得包裝嘅程序命令列。啟動前同啟動後命令仍然可以用。</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Group.Behavior">執行行為</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Wait.Title">等啟動前命令完成</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Wait.Desc">關閉嗰陣啟動前命令會喺背景執行，遊戲即刻啟動</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Timeout.Title">等待逾時時間（秒）</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Timeout.Desc">超過呢個時間之後會終止命令並繼續啟動遊戲，0 代表無限等待</x:String>
